               CYNTHIA RAYGUE - African, writer. She has been in Brazil several times doing field research.

JACKSON VALIM - PhD in Physics and Mathematics and works at NASA;
FABIO ZERPA - Argentinian, sociologist; founder of the organization for the organization of extraterrestrial phenomena; editor of the 4? DIMENSION magazine. He has already participated in other congresses in Brazil and programs of radio and television in his country;
TINO TIGUTO - Great author in his field, in the USA;
MAJOR KILONCHOVISQ - Specialist in UFOlogy, in ON0;
Commander GERSON MARCIEL DE BRITO - Former commander of VASP. Currently a commercial pilot and was involved in the accident of flight 169;
Dr. HERNESTO BORBA - Psychologist and writer;
PROF. SALVATORI PESSALVO - Engineer;
MARIA APARECIDA DE OLIVEIRA - Author in the field of advanced UFOlogy;
